eation/references/sequence-discipline.md\n/tmp/package/skills/ideation/references/world-modeling.md\n/tmp/package/skills/ideation/SKILL.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/executable-spec-cost.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/design-lenses.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/fixed-probe-defer.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/success-criteria.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/taxonomy-axis-checkpoint.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/public-executable-contracts.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/evidence-durability.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/references/acceptance-checks.md\n/tmp/package/skills/spec/SKILL.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/preset-conventions.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/portable-authoring.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/adapter-pattern.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/deployable-skill-packaging.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/integration-seams.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/runtime-capabilities.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/binary-preflight.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/references/adapter-contract.md\n/tmp/package/skills/create-skill/SKILL.md\n/tmp/package/skills/prove/references/verification-ladder.md\n/tmp/package/skills/prove/references/review-gate.md\n/tmp/package/skills/prove/SKILL.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/scripts/goal_artifact_template.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/coordination.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/goal-artifact.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/lifecycle-during.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/lifecycle-before.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/lifecycle.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/index.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/references/adapter-contract.md\n/tmp/package/skills/achieve/SKILL.md\n/tmp/package/skills/announcement/references/delivery-seams.md\n/tmp/package/skills/announcement/references/audience-policy.md\n/tmp/package/skills/announcement/references/draft-shape.md\n/tmp/package/skills/announcement/references/large-window-fanout.md\n/tmp/package/skills/announcement/references/adapter-contract.md\nfind: ‘standard output’: Broken pipe\nfind: write error\n\n-- repository --\n\"\"\"A minimal canonical-key catalog used by the consumer fixture.\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\n\nclass Catalog:\n    \"\"\"Resolve values by their canonical keys.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, mapping):\n        self._mapping = dict(mapping)\n\n    def resolve(self, key):\n        return self._mapping[key]\n\n-- tests --\nimport unittest\n\nfrom src.catalog import Catalog\n\n\nclass CatalogTests(unittest.TestCase):\n    def setUp(self):\n        self.catalog = Catalog({\"books\": [\"novel\"], \"music\": [\"jazz\"]})\n\n    def test_resolves_existing_canonical_keys(self):\n        self.assertEqual(self.catalog.resolve(\"books\"), [\"novel\"])\n        self.assertEqual(self.catalog.resolve(\"music\"), [\"jazz\"])\n\n    def test_unknown_key_raises_key_error(self):\n        with self.assertRaises(KeyError):\n            self.catalog.resolve(\"missing\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    unittest.main()\n\n-- readme --\n# Catalog fixture\n\nThis dependency-free seed exposes a deliberately small public API:\n\n```python\nfrom src.catalog import Catalog\n\ncatalog = Catalog({\"books\": [\"novel\"]})\ncatalog.resolve(\"books\")\n```\n\n`Catalog(mapping)` performs canonical-key lookup. An unknown key raises the\nnormal `KeyError`. The seed does not contain alias support or a generated\nspecification; those belong to the later journey contexts.\n\nRun the baseline with:\n\n```text\npython3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v\n```\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
